Eternally inspiring Serpenti takes shape as the Serpenti Villa, inviting guests to immerse themselves in the allure of the timeless icon. The exclusive new Villa is nestled in a dense tropical garden and designed for total comfort, with the 300-square-metre Serpenti Villa offering panoramic views of the Indian Ocean, framed by cascading thatched roofs. The shaded patio features an elegant minibar, infinity pool and sunbeds. All guests of the Villa will enjoy 24-hour butler service.

